---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import photo from "@assets/images/gallery/trucks/moffeti.webp";
import HomeIcon from "./HomeIcon.astro";
---

<section id="moffett" class="home-section moffett-section" aria-labelledby="moffett-title">
	<div class="home-wrap moffett-grid">
		<figure class="moffett-photo">
			<Image src={photo} alt="MOFFETT forklift beside a loaded flatbed trailer at an industrial site" width={800} widths={[400, 600, 800, 1200]} sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 510px, (min-width: 768px) 44vw, calc(100vw - 48px)" layout="full-width" />
			<figcaption><span>Forklift offloading</span><span>Delivered with the truck.</span></figcaption>
		</figure>
		<div class="moffett-copy">
			<p class="home-eyebrow">The MOFFETT difference</p>
			<h2 id="moffett-title" class="home-title">No forklift on site?<br />We bring one.</h2>
			<p class="moffett-intro">A MOFFETT is a forklift that travels on the back of the truck. When we arrive, it comes off the trailer to unload suitable materials at your site.</p>
			<div class="benefit">
				<span class="benefit-icon"><HomeIcon name="check" /></span>
				<div><h3>Delivery and offloading together</h3><p>You don't need to arrange a separate forklift for loads we can handle with our truck-mounted equipment.</p></div>
			</div>
			<div class="benefit">
				<span class="benefit-icon"><HomeIcon name="check" /></span>
				<div><h3>Plan the drop before we arrive</h3><p>Tell us about access and where the materials need to go. We'll discuss placement and equipment suitability before the delivery.</p></div>
			</div>
			<p class="access-note">Gates, ground conditions and load dimensions matter. Include them in your quote request so we can plan the offload.</p>
			<a class="home-button" href="#quote">Plan a MOFFETT delivery<HomeIcon name="arrow" /></a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style lang="less">
	.moffett-section {
		background: var(--home-paper);
	}

	.moffett-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1fr;
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
	}

	.moffett-photo {
		position: relative;
		min-width: 0;
		aspect-ratio: 0.92;
		border-radius: 3px;
		overflow: hidden;

		img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			object-fit: cover;
			object-position: center 70%;
		}

		figcaption {
			position: absolute;
			bottom: 1.25rem;
			left: 1.25rem;
			right: 1.25rem;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.25rem;
			padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
			border-left: 3px solid var(--home-green);
			background: #fffffff2;
			color: var(--home-forest);
			font-size: 0.8125rem;
			font-weight: 700;

			span + span {
				font-size: 0.6875rem;
				font-weight: 400;
			}
		}
	}

	.moffett-intro {
		margin-block: 1.5rem 2rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.benefit {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.375rem;

		h3 {
			margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
			font-size: 0.9375rem;
			line-height: 1.4;
		}

		p {
			font-size: 0.8125rem;
			line-height: 1.75;
		}
	}

	.benefit-icon {
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		width: 1.5rem;
		height: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 0.125rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #e0e9d9;
		color: var(--home-green);
		flex: none;

		svg {
			width: 1rem;
			height: 1rem;
		}
	}

	.access-note {
		margin-block: 1.75rem;
		padding-top: 1.25rem;
		border-top: 1px solid #d6dfcf;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	@media (max-width: 47.99rem) {
		.moffett-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}

		.moffett-photo {
			aspect-ratio: 1.05;
		}
	}
</style>
